@prefix bs:   <http://example.org/battlespace#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# =============================================================================
#  Battlespace ontology (TBox)
#
#  Describes the *kinds* of things that appear in AFSIM simulation output:
#  munition types, platform types, and the vocabulary used to describe force
#  structure. The scenario-specific order of battle lives in scenario_orbat.ttl.
#
#  ALIGNMENT WITH AFSIM - all of it is stated here and in the two other modules,
#  as OWL; nothing is hard-coded in the tools that query it.
#    afsim_alignment.ttl  every AFSIM type string is a bs:SimulationType
#                         individual of the class it denotes (bs:simTypeName)
#    scenario_orbat.ttl   every AFSIM platform is an individual of its platform
#                         class (bs:simPlatformName), bs:assignedTo its unit
#    Class facts (guidance, warhead, intended target) are owl:hasValue
#    restrictions, so a reasoner gives them to every individual of the class.
#    Coalition and platform nation are owl:propertyChainAxioms.
#
#  The usage guide and example queries served to agents are the skos:scopeNote
#  and skos:example annotations on the ontology header below.
#  All system data below is unclassified / open-source or notional.
# =============================================================================

<http://example.org/battlespace> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Battlespace ontology for AFSIM output analysis" ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.1" ;
    rdfs:comment "Knowledge that is NOT in the AFSIM output: the munition type hierarchy (which weapons are air-to-air missiles, precision-guided, cluster munitions, anti-radiation...), the platform type hierarchy (fighters, SAM launchers, engagement radars, command posts...), and the scenario's force structure (chain of command, echelons, nations, coalitions)." ;
    skos:scopeNote """REASONING IS ON: the endpoint holds the OWL-RL closure, so types, subclasses, the chain of command, inherited facets, coalitions and platform nations are already inferred - plain triple patterns are enough, no property paths needed.

AFSIM things are individuals. Each AFSIM type string (platforms.type, events.weapon_type) is a bs:SimulationType individual that is an instance of its ontology class and every superclass, and has that class's facets (bs:guidance, bs:warheadType, bs:intendedTarget). Each AFSIM platform is an individual of its platform class, linked by bs:simulationType to the individual for its AFSIM type. So to find the AFSIM strings for any category, query instances: ?t a bs:SimulationType , <category> ; bs:simTypeName ?name. A platform's AFSIM name and type string: ?p bs:simPlatformName ?name ; bs:simulationType/bs:simTypeName ?type.

Join keys - always put these literals in SQL, never IRI local names:
  bs:simTypeName     == platforms.type, events.weapon_type, weapon_inventory.weapon_type (one class may have several alias strings)
  bs:simPlatformName == platforms.name, events.platform, events.target
  bs:simSideName     == platforms.side (on bs:Coalition individuals)

Force structure: units (bs:MilitaryUnit) have bs:echelon, bs:nation, bs:service and are bs:directlySubordinateTo their parent unit; platforms are bs:assignedTo the one unit that owns them. Both are single steps. bs:subordinateTo is the inferred whole chain: use it for 'platforms or units under a unit at any depth'. Units and platforms carry inferred bs:coalition; platforms carry inferred bs:nation. bs:hasSubordinate is the inverse of bs:subordinateTo (unit -> everything under it).

Unit functions are DEFINED classes the reasoner infers from equipment, e.g. bs:SAMBattalion (with subclasses bs:IntegratedSAMBattalion and bs:SHORADBattalion): query ?u a bs:SAMBattalion directly; their rdfs:comment states what each needs to be mission-capable.

Start with ontology_overview.""" ;
    skos:example """# exact AFSIM strings for every air-to-air missile (use them in SQL)
SELECT ?name WHERE { ?t a bs:SimulationType , bs:AirToAirMissile ; bs:simTypeName ?name }""" ,
        """# inherited facet: every AFSIM weapon string with a submunition (cluster) warhead
SELECT ?name WHERE { ?t a bs:SimulationType ; bs:warheadType bs:Submunitions ; bs:simTypeName ?name }""" ,
        """# Blue brigade-level units (brigade / regiment / wing), coalition inferred
SELECT ?unit ?label WHERE { ?unit a bs:MilitaryUnit ; bs:echelon bs:Brigade ; bs:coalition bs:BlueCoalition ; rdfs:label ?label }""" ,
        """# every AFSIM platform under each Blue brigade at ANY depth - use bs:subordinateTo, not bs:assignedTo
SELECT ?label ?platform WHERE { ?unit bs:echelon bs:Brigade ; bs:coalition bs:BlueCoalition ; rdfs:label ?label .
  ?p bs:subordinateTo ?unit ; bs:simPlatformName ?platform }""" ,
        """# AFSIM platform names with their inferred nation and coalition
SELECT ?platform ?nation ?coalition WHERE { ?p bs:simPlatformName ?platform ; bs:nation ?nation ; bs:coalition ?coalition }""" ,
        """# platforms of a type category (here engagement radars): AFSIM name, AFSIM type and owning unit
SELECT ?platform ?type ?unit WHERE { ?p a bs:EngagementRadar ; bs:simPlatformName ?platform ;
  bs:simulationType/bs:simTypeName ?type ; bs:assignedTo ?u . ?u rdfs:label ?unit }""" ,
        """# every Red SAM battalion (inferred class), its kind, and each platform with its air defence role and AFSIM type
SELECT ?battalion ?kind ?platform ?type ?role WHERE { ?b a bs:SAMBattalion , ?kind ; bs:coalition bs:RedForce ; rdfs:label ?battalion .
  VALUES ?kind { bs:IntegratedSAMBattalion bs:SHORADBattalion }
  ?b bs:hasSubordinate ?p . ?p bs:simPlatformName ?platform ; bs:simulationType/bs:simTypeName ?type ; a ?role .
  VALUES ?role { bs:SAMLauncher bs:EngagementRadar bs:AirDefenseCommandPost bs:SHORADSystem } }""" .

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Properties
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

bs:simTypeName a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "AFSIM type name" ;
    rdfs:domain bs:SimulationType ;
    rdfs:comment "Exact type string emitted by AFSIM (platforms.type, events.weapon_type, weapon_inventory.weapon_type), on a bs:SimulationType individual." .

bs:simulationType a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "AFSIM type" ;
    rdfs:range bs:SimulationType ;
    rdfs:comment "Platform -> the bs:SimulationType individual for its AFSIM type (platforms.type). So a platform's AFSIM type string is ?p bs:simulationType/bs:simTypeName ?type." .

bs:simPlatformName a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "simulation platform name" ;
    rdfs:comment "Exact platform name in the simulation output (platforms.name, events.platform, events.target)." .

bs:simSideName a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "simulation side name" ;
    rdfs:comment "Exact side string in the simulation output (platforms.side)." .

bs:guidance a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "guidance" ;
    rdfs:range bs:GuidanceMethod ;
    rdfs:comment "Guidance method of a munition (value is a bs:GuidanceMethod individual). Stated on classes as owl:hasValue restrictions, so it holds for every subclass and every AFSIM type individual of that class." .

bs:warheadType a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "warhead type" ;
    rdfs:range bs:WarheadType ;
    rdfs:comment "Warhead / payload type of a munition (value is a bs:WarheadType individual). Stated on classes as owl:hasValue restrictions, so it holds for every subclass and every AFSIM type individual of that class." .

bs:intendedTarget a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "intended target" ;
    rdfs:range bs:TargetSet ;
    rdfs:comment "Target set a munition is designed to engage (value is a bs:TargetSet individual). Stated on classes as owl:hasValue restrictions, so it holds for every subclass and every AFSIM type individual of that class." .

bs:canCarry a owl:AnnotationProperty ;
    rdfs:label "can carry" ;
    rdfs:comment "Platform type (class) can carry / employ the munition type (class) in this scenario's loadouts." .

bs:subordinateTo a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:TransitiveProperty ;
    rdfs:label "subordinate to" ;
    rdfs:comment "Whole chain of command: a platform or unit is subordinate to every unit above it. Inferred (transitive) from bs:assignedTo and bs:directlySubordinateTo." .

bs:hasSubordinate a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    owl:inverseOf bs:subordinateTo ;
    rdfs:label "has subordinate" ;
    rdfs:comment "Unit -> every unit and platform below it in the chain of command (inverse of bs:subordinateTo; inferred). Used to classify units by the equipment they command." .

bs:directlySubordinateTo a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf bs:subordinateTo ;
    rdfs:label "directly subordinate to" ;
    rdfs:comment "Unit -> its immediate parent unit. Not transitive." ;
    rdfs:domain bs:MilitaryUnit ;
    rdfs:range bs:MilitaryUnit .

bs:assignedTo a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf bs:subordinateTo ;
    rdfs:label "assigned to" ;
    rdfs:comment "Platform -> the unit that owns and operates it (lowest echelon only). Not transitive." ;
    rdfs:range bs:MilitaryUnit .

bs:echelon a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "echelon" ;
    rdfs:domain bs:MilitaryUnit ;
    rdfs:range bs:Echelon .

bs:nation a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "nation" ;
    rdfs:comment "Nation that owns a unit (asserted) or a platform (inferred from the unit it is assigned to)." ;
    rdfs:range bs:Nation ;
    owl:propertyChainAxiom ( bs:assignedTo bs:nation ) .

bs:service a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "service" ;
    rdfs:domain bs:MilitaryUnit ;
    rdfs:range bs:Service .

bs:memberOf a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "member of" ;
    rdfs:domain bs:Nation ;
    rdfs:range bs:Coalition .

bs:coalition a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "coalition" ;
    rdfs:comment "Coalition (side) a unit or platform belongs to. Inferred, never asserted: a unit's nation's coalition, and for anything in a chain of command, its superior's coalition." ;
    rdfs:range bs:Coalition ;
    owl:propertyChainAxiom ( bs:nation bs:memberOf ) , ( bs:subordinateTo bs:coalition ) .

bs:SimulationType a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "AFSIM type" ;
    rdfs:comment "An individual standing for one type string emitted by AFSIM (platforms.type / events.weapon_type), carrying it in bs:simTypeName. Each is an instance of the ontology class it denotes, so with reasoning it is also an instance of every superclass and inherits that class's guidance, warhead and intended-target facets. Defined in afsim_alignment.ttl." .

bs:echelonRank a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "echelon rank" ;
    rdfs:comment "Ordering of echelons; larger = higher in the chain of command." ;
    rdfs:domain bs:Echelon ;
    rdfs:range xsd:integer .

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Organisational vocabulary
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

bs:MilitaryUnit a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Military unit" .
bs:Echelon      a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Echelon" .
bs:Nation       a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Nation" .
bs:Coalition    a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Coalition / side" .
bs:Service      a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Military service" .

bs:JointForce a bs:Echelon ; rdfs:label "Joint force" ; bs:echelonRank 9 .
bs:Component  a bs:Echelon ; rdfs:label "Component command / Army / Fleet" ; bs:echelonRank 8 .
bs:Corps      a bs:Echelon ; rdfs:label "Corps" ; bs:echelonRank 7 .
bs:Division   a bs:Echelon ; rdfs:label "Division" ; bs:echelonRank 6 .
bs:Brigade    a bs:Echelon ; rdfs:label "Brigade / Regiment / Wing" ; skos:altLabel "Regiment" , "Wing" ; bs:echelonRank 5 .
bs:Battalion  a bs:Echelon ; rdfs:label "Battalion / Squadron / Ship" ; skos:altLabel "Squadron" ; bs:echelonRank 4 .
bs:Company    a bs:Echelon ; rdfs:label "Company / Battery / Troop / Flight" ; skos:altLabel "Battery" , "Flight" ; bs:echelonRank 3 .
bs:Platoon    a bs:Echelon ; rdfs:label "Platoon / Section / Team" ; bs:echelonRank 2 .

bs:Air      a bs:Service ; rdfs:label "Air Force" .
bs:Land     a bs:Service ; rdfs:label "Army / Land Forces" .
bs:Maritime a bs:Service ; rdfs:label "Navy" .

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Munition facets
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

bs:GuidanceMethod a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Guidance method" .
bs:Unguided            a bs:GuidanceMethod ; rdfs:label "Unguided / ballistic" .
bs:GPS_INS             a bs:GuidanceMethod ; rdfs:label "GPS-aided inertial" .
bs:SemiActiveLaser     a bs:GuidanceMethod ; rdfs:label "Semi-active laser" .
bs:ActiveRadar         a bs:GuidanceMethod ; rdfs:label "Active radar homing" .
bs:SemiActiveRadar     a bs:GuidanceMethod ; rdfs:label "Semi-active radar homing" .
bs:InfraredHoming      a bs:GuidanceMethod ; rdfs:label "Infrared / imaging-infrared homing" .
bs:PassiveRadarHoming  a bs:GuidanceMethod ; rdfs:label "Passive radar (anti-radiation) homing" .
bs:CommandGuidance     a bs:GuidanceMethod ; rdfs:label "Radio command guidance" .
bs:SACLOS              a bs:GuidanceMethod ; rdfs:label "SACLOS (wire / laser beam riding)" .
bs:MultiMode           a bs:GuidanceMethod ; rdfs:label "Multi-mode seeker" .
bs:ElectroOpticalDatalink a bs:GuidanceMethod ; rdfs:label "Electro-optical with operator datalink" .

bs:WarheadType a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Warhead type" .
bs:Unitary            a bs:WarheadType ; rdfs:label "Unitary HE / blast-frag" .
bs:Submunitions       a bs:WarheadType ; rdfs:label "Submunitions (cluster / ICM / DPICM)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Any payload that dispenses multiple submunitions. Munitions with this warhead are cluster munitions." .
bs:PreformedFragments a bs:WarheadType ; rdfs:label "Pre-formed fragment (alternative warhead)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Area-effect warhead of tungsten pellets with no submunitions; NOT a cluster munition." .
bs:KineticPenetrator  a bs:WarheadType ; rdfs:label "Kinetic energy penetrator" .
bs:ShapedCharge       a bs:WarheadType ; rdfs:label "Shaped charge / tandem HEAT" .
bs:HitToKill          a bs:WarheadType ; rdfs:label "Hit-to-kill" .

bs:TargetSet a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Target set" .
bs:AirTargets       a bs:TargetSet ; rdfs:label "Air targets (aircraft, UAVs)" .
bs:MissileTargets   a bs:TargetSet ; rdfs:label "Missile / munition targets (C-RAM, cruise and ballistic missile defence)" .
bs:LandTargets      a bs:TargetSet ; rdfs:label "Land targets" .
bs:ArmoredTargets   a bs:TargetSet ; rdfs:label "Armored vehicles" .
bs:MaritimeTargets  a bs:TargetSet ; rdfs:label "Ships" .
bs:EmitterTargets   a bs:TargetSet ; rdfs:label "Radars / emitters (SEAD)" .

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  MUNITION HIERARCHY
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

bs:Munition a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Munition" ;
    rdfs:comment "Any expendable weapon released, fired or launched by a platform." .

# ---- Cross-cutting classes ---------------------------------------------------

bs:PrecisionGuidedMunition a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:Munition ;
    rdfs:label "Precision-guided munition (PGM)" ;
    skos:altLabel "PGM" , "smart weapon" , "guided munition" ;
    rdfs:comment "Any munition that actively guides to its target after release: all missiles, guided bombs, guided rockets, guided artillery projectiles and loitering munitions." .

bs:UnguidedMunition a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:Munition ;
    rdfs:label "Unguided munition" ;
    skos:altLabel "dumb munition" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:Unguided ] .

bs:ClusterMunition a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:Munition ;
    rdfs:label "Cluster munition" ;
    skos:altLabel "submunition weapon" , "ICM" , "DPICM" , "cargo munition" ;
    rdfs:comment "Munition that disperses submunitions. Every class with warheadType bs:Submunitions is asserted a subclass of this." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Submunitions ] .

# ---- Missiles ----------------------------------------------------------------

bs:Missile a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:Munition , bs:PrecisionGuidedMunition ;
    rdfs:label "Missile" .

bs:AirToAirMissile a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:Missile ;
    rdfs:label "Air-to-air missile (AAM)" ;
    skos:altLabel "AAM" ;
    rdfs:comment "Missile launched from an aircraft at an air target. Surface-launched derivatives of AAM airframes (e.g. AMRAAM-ER) are surface-to-air missiles, not AAMs." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:intendedTarget ; owl:hasValue bs:AirTargets ] .

bs:InfraredAAM a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:AirToAirMissile ;
    rdfs:label "Infrared-guided AAM (short range)" ;
    skos:altLabel "WVR AAM" , "dogfight missile" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:InfraredHoming ] .

bs:RadarGuidedAAM a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:AirToAirMissile ;
    rdfs:label "Radar-guided AAM (beyond visual range)" ;
    skos:altLabel "BVRAAM" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:ActiveRadar ] .

bs:AIM-9X a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:InfraredAAM ;
    rdfs:label "AIM-9X Sidewinder Block II" ; skos:altLabel "Sidewinder" .
bs:AIM-132 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:InfraredAAM ;
    rdfs:label "AIM-132 ASRAAM" ; skos:altLabel "ASRAAM" .
bs:R-73M a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:InfraredAAM ;
    rdfs:label "R-73M (AA-11 Archer)" ; skos:altLabel "AA-11 Archer" .
bs:KestrelAAM a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:InfraredAAM ;
    rdfs:label "Kestrel compact IR AAM (notional)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Notional scenario weapon: compact imaging-IR dogfight missile carried in quantity by F-15EX." .

bs:AIM-120D a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:RadarGuidedAAM ;
    rdfs:label "AIM-120D AMRAAM" ; skos:altLabel "AMRAAM" , "Slammer" .
bs:AIM-120C-7 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:RadarGuidedAAM ;
    rdfs:label "AIM-120C-7 AMRAAM" ; skos:altLabel "AMRAAM" .
bs:Meteor a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:RadarGuidedAAM ;
    rdfs:label "MBDA Meteor (ramjet BVRAAM)" .
bs:R-77-1 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:RadarGuidedAAM ;
    rdfs:label "R-77-1 (AA-12B Adder)" ; skos:altLabel "AA-12 Adder" , "RVV-SD" .
bs:R-37M a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:RadarGuidedAAM ;
    rdfs:label "R-37M (AA-13 Axehead)" ; skos:altLabel "AA-13 Axehead" , "RVV-BD" , "izdeliye 610M" .

bs:SurfaceToAirMissile a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:Missile ;
    rdfs:label "Surface-to-air missile (SAM)" ;
    skos:altLabel "SAM" , "interceptor" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:intendedTarget ; owl:hasValue bs:AirTargets ] , [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:intendedTarget ; owl:hasValue bs:MissileTargets ] .

bs:LongRangeSAM   a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:SurfaceToAirMissile ; rdfs:label "Long-range SAM" .
bs:MediumRangeSAM a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:SurfaceToAirMissile ; rdfs:label "Medium-range SAM" .
bs:ShortRangeSAM  a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:SurfaceToAirMissile ; rdfs:label "Short-range SAM / SHORAD missile" .
bs:BallisticMissileInterceptor a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:SurfaceToAirMissile ;
    rdfs:label "Ballistic missile defence interceptor" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:HitToKill ] .

bs:48N6E3 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LongRangeSAM ;
    rdfs:label "48N6E3 (S-400)" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:SemiActiveRadar ] .
bs:40N6E a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LongRangeSAM ;
    rdfs:label "40N6E very-long-range SAM (S-400)" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:ActiveRadar ] .
bs:9M96E2 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:MediumRangeSAM ;
    rdfs:label "9M96E2 (S-400 / S-350)" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:ActiveRadar ] .
bs:9M317M a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:MediumRangeSAM ;
    rdfs:label "9M317M (Buk-M3)" ; skos:altLabel "SA-17 Grizzly" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:SemiActiveRadar ] .
bs:57E6E a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:ShortRangeSAM ;
    rdfs:label "57E6E (Pantsir-S1)" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:CommandGuidance ] .
bs:9M338K a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:ShortRangeSAM ;
    rdfs:label "9M338K (Tor-M2)" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:CommandGuidance ] .
bs:PAC-3_MSE a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LongRangeSAM , bs:BallisticMissileInterceptor ;
    rdfs:label "PAC-3 MSE (Patriot)" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:ActiveRadar ] .
bs:GEM-T a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LongRangeSAM ;
    rdfs:label "MIM-104E GEM-T (Patriot)" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:SemiActiveRadar ] .
bs:AMRAAM-ER a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:MediumRangeSAM ;
    rdfs:label "AMRAAM-ER (NASAMS)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Surface-launched extended-range derivative of AMRAAM fired from NASAMS. It is a SAM, not an air-to-air missile." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:ActiveRadar ] .
bs:FIM-92K a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:ShortRangeSAM ;
    rdfs:label "FIM-92K Stinger" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:InfraredHoming ] .
bs:SM-2 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LongRangeSAM ;
    rdfs:label "RIM-66 SM-2 Block IIIC" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:ActiveRadar ] .
bs:SM-6 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LongRangeSAM , bs:BallisticMissileInterceptor , bs:AntiShipMissile ;
    rdfs:label "RIM-174 SM-6 Block IA" ;
    rdfs:comment "Multi-mission: anti-air, terminal BMD and anti-surface." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:ActiveRadar ] .
bs:ESSM a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:MediumRangeSAM ;
    rdfs:label "RIM-162D ESSM Block 2" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:ActiveRadar ] .

bs:AirToSurfaceMissile a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:Missile ;
    rdfs:label "Air-to-surface missile" ;
    skos:altLabel "ASM" .

bs:AntiRadiationMissile a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:AirToSurfaceMissile ;
    rdfs:label "Anti-radiation missile (ARM)" ;
    skos:altLabel "ARM" , "SEAD missile" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:PassiveRadarHoming ] ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:intendedTarget ; owl:hasValue bs:EmitterTargets ] .

bs:AGM-88E a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AntiRadiationMissile ;
    rdfs:label "AGM-88E AARGM" ; skos:altLabel "HARM" .
bs:AGM-88G a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AntiRadiationMissile ;
    rdfs:label "AGM-88G AARGM-ER" .
bs:Kh-31PD a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AntiRadiationMissile ;
    rdfs:label "Kh-31PD (AS-17 Krypton)" ; skos:altLabel "AS-17 Krypton" .

bs:CruiseMissile a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:Missile ;
    rdfs:label "Cruise missile" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .

bs:LandAttackCruiseMissile a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:CruiseMissile ;
    rdfs:label "Land-attack cruise missile" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:GPS_INS ] ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:intendedTarget ; owl:hasValue bs:LandTargets ] .

bs:JASSM-ER a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LandAttackCruiseMissile , bs:AirToSurfaceMissile ;
    rdfs:label "AGM-158B JASSM-ER" .
bs:Kh-59MK2 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LandAttackCruiseMissile , bs:AirToSurfaceMissile ;
    rdfs:label "Kh-59MK2" .
bs:Tomahawk a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LandAttackCruiseMissile ;
    rdfs:label "BGM-109E Tomahawk Block IV" ; skos:altLabel "TLAM" .
bs:3M14 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LandAttackCruiseMissile ;
    rdfs:label "3M14 Kalibr (land attack)" ; skos:altLabel "SS-N-30A" , "Kalibr-NK" .
bs:9M728 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LandAttackCruiseMissile ;
    rdfs:label "9M728 (Iskander-K)" ; skos:altLabel "SSC-7" .

bs:AntiShipMissile a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:Missile ;
    rdfs:label "Anti-ship missile" ;
    skos:altLabel "ASCM" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:intendedTarget ; owl:hasValue bs:MaritimeTargets ] .

bs:NSM a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AntiShipMissile , bs:CruiseMissile ;
    rdfs:label "Naval Strike Missile" ;
    skos:altLabel "NSM" , "RGM-184A" ;
    rdfs:comment "Norwegian federate names it NSM_BLK1A; the US Navy model library uses the US designation RGM-184A." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:InfraredHoming ] .
bs:P-800 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AntiShipMissile , bs:CruiseMissile ;
    rdfs:label "P-800 Oniks (SS-N-26 Strobile)" ; skos:altLabel "Oniks" , "Yakhont" , "3M55" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:ActiveRadar ] .
bs:3M54 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AntiShipMissile , bs:CruiseMissile ;
    rdfs:label "3M54 Kalibr (anti-ship)" ; skos:altLabel "SS-N-27 Sizzler" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:ActiveRadar ] .

bs:BallisticMissile a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:Missile ;
    rdfs:label "Surface-to-surface ballistic missile" ;
    skos:altLabel "SRBM" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:GPS_INS ] ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:intendedTarget ; owl:hasValue bs:LandTargets ] .

bs:9M723 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:BallisticMissile ;
    rdfs:label "9M723 (Iskander-M)" ; skos:altLabel "SS-26 Stone" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .
bs:PrSM a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:BallisticMissile ;
    rdfs:label "Precision Strike Missile Increment 1" ; skos:altLabel "PrSM" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .
bs:ATACMS_BlkIA a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:BallisticMissile , bs:ClusterMunition ;
    rdfs:label "MGM-140B ATACMS Block IA" ;
    skos:altLabel "ATACMS" ;
    rdfs:comment "Carries ~300 M74 APAM submunitions." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Submunitions ] .

bs:AntiTankGuidedMissile a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:Missile ;
    rdfs:label "Anti-tank guided missile (ATGM)" ;
    skos:altLabel "ATGM" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:ShapedCharge ] ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:intendedTarget ; owl:hasValue bs:ArmoredTargets ] .

bs:GunLaunchedATGM a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:AntiTankGuidedMissile ;
    rdfs:label "Gun/barrel-launched ATGM" ;
    rdfs:comment "Guided missile fired through a tank or IFV main gun." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:SACLOS ] .

bs:BGM-71F a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AntiTankGuidedMissile ;
    rdfs:label "BGM-71F TOW-2B" ; skos:altLabel "TOW" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:SACLOS ] .
bs:9M133M-2 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AntiTankGuidedMissile ;
    rdfs:label "9M133M-2 Kornet-M" ; skos:altLabel "AT-14 Spriggan" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:SACLOS ] .
bs:9M119M a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:GunLaunchedATGM ;
    rdfs:label "9M119M Refleks-M (tank-gun-launched)" ; skos:altLabel "AT-11 Sniper" .
bs:9M117M1 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:GunLaunchedATGM ;
    rdfs:label "9M117M1 Arkan (100 mm gun-launched)" ; skos:altLabel "AT-10 Stabber" .
bs:AGM-114R a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AntiTankGuidedMissile , bs:AirToSurfaceMissile ;
    rdfs:label "AGM-114R Hellfire Romeo" ; skos:altLabel "Hellfire" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:SemiActiveLaser ] .
bs:AGM-179 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AntiTankGuidedMissile , bs:AirToSurfaceMissile ;
    rdfs:label "AGM-179 JAGM" ; skos:altLabel "JAGM" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:MultiMode ] .
bs:9M127-1 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AntiTankGuidedMissile , bs:AirToSurfaceMissile ;
    rdfs:label "9M127-1 Vikhr-M" ; skos:altLabel "AT-16 Scallion" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:SACLOS ] .

# ---- Bombs -------------------------------------------------------------------

bs:Bomb a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:Munition ; rdfs:label "Aerial bomb" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:intendedTarget ; owl:hasValue bs:LandTargets ] .

bs:GuidedBomb a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:Bomb , bs:PrecisionGuidedMunition ;
    rdfs:label "Guided bomb" ;
    skos:altLabel "smart bomb" , "glide bomb" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .

bs:LaserGuidedBomb     a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:GuidedBomb ; rdfs:label "Laser-guided bomb (LGB)" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:SemiActiveLaser ] .
bs:SatelliteGuidedBomb a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:GuidedBomb ; rdfs:label "GPS/INS-guided bomb" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:GPS_INS ] .
bs:MultiModeGuidedBomb a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:GuidedBomb ; rdfs:label "Multi-mode guided bomb" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:MultiMode ] .

bs:GBU-12 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LaserGuidedBomb ;
    rdfs:label "GBU-12 Paveway II" .
bs:GBU-31 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:SatelliteGuidedBomb ;
    rdfs:label "GBU-31(V)3 JDAM" ; skos:altLabel "JDAM" .
bs:GBU-39 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:SatelliteGuidedBomb ;
    rdfs:label "GBU-39 Small Diameter Bomb" ; skos:altLabel "SDB" .
bs:GBU-53 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:MultiModeGuidedBomb ;
    rdfs:label "GBU-53/B StormBreaker" ; skos:altLabel "SDB II" .
bs:TridentGlideKit a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:SatelliteGuidedBomb ;
    rdfs:label "Trident glide kit (notional)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Notional scenario weapon: wing + GPS/INS tail kit fitted to a 500 lb general-purpose bomb." .
bs:KAB-500S a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:SatelliteGuidedBomb ;
    rdfs:label "KAB-500S-E" .
bs:KAB-20S a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:SatelliteGuidedBomb ;
    rdfs:label "KAB-20S small guided bomb (UAV-launched)" .

bs:UnguidedBomb a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:Bomb , bs:UnguidedMunition ; rdfs:label "Unguided general-purpose bomb" .
bs:FAB-500M62 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:UnguidedBomb ;
    rdfs:label "FAB-500M-62" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .

bs:ClusterBomb a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:Bomb , bs:ClusterMunition , bs:UnguidedMunition ;
    rdfs:label "Cluster bomb (dispenser)" .
bs:RBK-500_SPBE a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:ClusterBomb ;
    rdfs:label "RBK-500 SPBE-D" ;
    rdfs:comment "Unguided dispenser carrying 15 sensor-fuzed anti-armor submunitions." .

# ---- Rockets -----------------------------------------------------------------

bs:Rocket a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:Munition ; rdfs:label "Rocket" .

bs:GuidedRocket a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:Rocket , bs:PrecisionGuidedMunition ;
    rdfs:label "Guided rocket" .

bs:APKWS a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:GuidedRocket ;
    rdfs:label "APKWS II (laser-guided 70 mm rocket)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Hydra-70 rocket with a mid-body laser guidance section." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:SemiActiveLaser ] ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .
bs:GMLRS_Unitary a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:GuidedRocket ;
    rdfs:label "M31A2 GMLRS Unitary" ; skos:altLabel "GMLRS" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:GPS_INS ] ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .
bs:GMLRS_AW a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:GuidedRocket ;
    rdfs:label "M30A2 GMLRS Alternative Warhead" ; skos:altLabel "GMLRS-AW" ;
    rdfs:comment "Replaced the M30 DPICM rocket. Pre-formed tungsten fragments, NO submunitions: not a cluster munition." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:GPS_INS ] ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:PreformedFragments ] .
bs:9M542 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:GuidedRocket ;
    rdfs:label "9M542 guided rocket (Tornado-S)" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:GPS_INS ] ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .

bs:UnguidedRocket a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:Rocket , bs:UnguidedMunition ; rdfs:label "Unguided rocket" .
bs:Hydra70_M151 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:UnguidedRocket ;
    rdfs:label "Hydra-70 M151 HE" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .
bs:S-8KOM a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:UnguidedRocket ;
    rdfs:label "S-8KOM 80 mm rocket" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:ShapedCharge ] .
bs:9M55K a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:UnguidedRocket , bs:ClusterMunition ;
    rdfs:label "9M55K 300 mm cargo rocket" ;
    rdfs:comment "Carries 72 9N235 fragmentation submunitions." .
bs:Burya12 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:UnguidedRocket , bs:ClusterMunition ;
    rdfs:label "Burya-12 cargo rocket (notional)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Notional scenario weapon: 300 mm rocket dispensing anti-armor submunitions." .

# ---- Artillery projectiles ---------------------------------------------------

bs:ArtilleryProjectile a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:Munition ; rdfs:label "Artillery projectile" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:intendedTarget ; owl:hasValue bs:LandTargets ] .

bs:GuidedProjectile a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:ArtilleryProjectile , bs:PrecisionGuidedMunition ;
    rdfs:label "Guided artillery projectile" ;
    skos:altLabel "precision artillery" .

bs:M982 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:GuidedProjectile ;
    rdfs:label "M982A1 Excalibur 155 mm" ; skos:altLabel "Excalibur" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:GPS_INS ] ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .
bs:Krasnopol a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:GuidedProjectile ;
    rdfs:label "3OF39 Krasnopol 152 mm" ; skos:altLabel "Krasnopol" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:SemiActiveLaser ] ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .

bs:UnguidedProjectile a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:ArtilleryProjectile , bs:UnguidedMunition ; rdfs:label "Conventional artillery projectile" .
bs:M795 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:UnguidedProjectile ;
    rdfs:label "M795 155 mm HE" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .
bs:XM1113 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:UnguidedProjectile ;
    rdfs:label "XM1113 155 mm rocket-assisted HE" ;
    rdfs:comment "Extended-range rocket-assisted projectile. Unguided." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .
bs:3OF45 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:UnguidedProjectile ;
    rdfs:label "3OF45 152 mm HE-FRAG" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .
bs:3O23 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:UnguidedProjectile , bs:ClusterMunition ;
    rdfs:label "3-O-23 152 mm cargo projectile (ICM)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Carries 42 3-O-16 HEAT-frag submunitions." .

# ---- Direct-fire gun ammunition ---------------------------------------------

bs:DirectFireAmmunition a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:UnguidedMunition ; rdfs:label "Direct-fire gun ammunition" .
bs:KineticEnergyRound a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:DirectFireAmmunition ;
    rdfs:label "APFSDS kinetic energy round" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:KineticPenetrator ] ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:intendedTarget ; owl:hasValue bs:ArmoredTargets ] .
bs:HEATRound a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:DirectFireAmmunition ;
    rdfs:label "HEAT / multi-purpose gun round" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:ShapedCharge ] .
bs:HEFragRound a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:DirectFireAmmunition ;
    rdfs:label "HE-FRAG gun round" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] .

bs:M829A4  a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:KineticEnergyRound ; rdfs:label "M829A4 120 mm APFSDS-T" .
bs:3BM60   a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:KineticEnergyRound ; rdfs:label "3BM60 Svinets-2 125 mm APFSDS" .
bs:M919    a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:KineticEnergyRound ; rdfs:label "M919 25 mm APFSDS-T" .
bs:3UBR8   a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:KineticEnergyRound ; rdfs:label "3UBR8 30 mm APDS" .
bs:M830A1  a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:HEATRound ; rdfs:label "M830A1 120 mm MPAT" .
bs:3OF26   a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:HEFragRound ; rdfs:label "3OF26 125 mm HE-FRAG" .

# ---- Loitering munitions -----------------------------------------------------

bs:LoiteringMunition a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:PrecisionGuidedMunition ;
    rdfs:label "Loitering munition" ;
    skos:altLabel "kamikaze drone" , "suicide drone" , "one-way attack UAS" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:warheadType ; owl:hasValue bs:Unitary ] ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:intendedTarget ; owl:hasValue bs:LandTargets ] .

bs:OneWayAttackUAV a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf bs:LoiteringMunition ;
    rdfs:label "Long-range one-way attack UAV" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:GPS_INS ] .

bs:Switchblade600 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LoiteringMunition ;
    rdfs:label "Switchblade 600" ; rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:ElectroOpticalDatalink ] .
bs:Lancet3 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LoiteringMunition ;
    rdfs:label "ZALA Lancet-3" ; skos:altLabel "Lancet" , "izdeliye 52" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:ElectroOpticalDatalink ] .
bs:VoronK a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:LoiteringMunition ;
    rdfs:label "Voron-K loitering munition (notional)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Notional scenario weapon: tube-launched loitering munition with anti-armor warhead." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty bs:guidance ; owl:hasValue bs:ElectroOpticalDatalink ] .
bs:Geran2 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:OneWayAttackUAV ;
    rdfs:label "Geran-2" ; skos:altLabel "Shahed-136" .

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  PLATFORM TYPE HIERARCHY
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

bs:Platform a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Platform" ;
    rdfs:comment "Anything represented as a platform in the simulation: aircraft, vehicles, ships, sites, teams." .

bs:Aircraft a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:Platform ; rdfs:label "Aircraft" .
bs:FixedWingAircraft a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:Aircraft ; rdfs:label "Fixed-wing aircraft" .
bs:FighterAircraft a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:FixedWingAircraft ; rdfs:label "Fighter aircraft" .
bs:MultiroleFighter a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:FighterAircraft ; rdfs:label "Multirole fighter" .
bs:InterceptorAircraft a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:FighterAircraft ; rdfs:label "Interceptor" .
bs:SEADAircraft a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:FixedWingAircraft ; rdfs:label "SEAD aircraft (Wild Weasel role)" .
bs:StrikeAircraft a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:FixedWingAircraft ; rdfs:label "Strike aircraft / fighter-bomber" .
bs:Bomber a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:StrikeAircraft ; rdfs:label "Bomber" .
bs:HighValueAirborneAsset a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:FixedWingAircraft ; rdfs:label "High-value airborne asset (HVAA)" ;
    skos:altLabel "HVAA" .
bs:AEWandC a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:HighValueAirborneAsset ; rdfs:label "Airborne early warning & control" ; skos:altLabel "AWACS" .
bs:TankerAircraft a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:HighValueAirborneAsset ; rdfs:label "Air refueling tanker" .
bs:RotaryWingAircraft a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:Aircraft ; rdfs:label "Rotary-wing aircraft" .
bs:AttackHelicopter a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:RotaryWingAircraft ; rdfs:label "Attack helicopter" .
bs:UncrewedAircraft a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:Aircraft ; rdfs:label "Uncrewed aircraft (MALE UAS)" ; skos:altLabel "UAV" , "drone" .

bs:F-35A a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:MultiroleFighter ; rdfs:label "F-35A Lightning II" .
bs:F-16CM a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:MultiroleFighter , bs:SEADAircraft ; rdfs:label "F-16CM Block 50 (SEAD)" .
bs:F-15EX a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:MultiroleFighter ; rdfs:label "F-15EX Eagle II" .
bs:TyphoonFGR4 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:MultiroleFighter ; rdfs:label "Eurofighter Typhoon FGR4" .
bs:B-1B a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:Bomber ; rdfs:label "B-1B Lancer" .
bs:E-3G a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AEWandC ; rdfs:label "E-3G Sentry" .
bs:KC-46A a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:TankerAircraft ; rdfs:label "KC-46A Pegasus" .
bs:MQ-9A a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:UncrewedAircraft ; rdfs:label "MQ-9A Reaper" .
bs:AH-64E a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AttackHelicopter ; rdfs:label "AH-64E Apache Guardian" .
bs:Su-35S a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:MultiroleFighter ; rdfs:label "Su-35S Flanker-E" .
bs:Su-34 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:StrikeAircraft ; rdfs:label "Su-34 Fullback" .
bs:MiG-31BM a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:InterceptorAircraft ; rdfs:label "MiG-31BM Foxhound" .
bs:A-50U a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AEWandC ; rdfs:label "A-50U Mainstay" .
bs:Ka-52 a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:AttackHelicopter ; rdfs:label "Ka-52 Alligator" .
bs:Inokhodets a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:UncrewedAircraft ; rdfs:label "Orion (Inokhodets) MALE UAV" ; skos:altLabel "Orion" .

bs:GroundVehicle a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:Platform ; rdfs:label "Ground vehicle / ground system" .
bs:ArmoredCombatVehicle a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:GroundVehicle ; rdfs:label "Armored combat vehicle" .
bs:MainBattleTank a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:ArmoredCombatVehicle ; rdfs:label "Main battle tank" .
bs:InfantryFightingVehicle a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:ArmoredCombatVehicle ; rdfs:label "Infantry fighting vehicle" .
bs:FiresSystem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:GroundVehicle ; rdfs:label "Indirect fires system" .
bs:SelfPropelledHowitzer a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:FiresSystem ; rdfs:label "Self-propelled howitzer" .
bs:RocketArtillery a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:FiresSystem ; rdfs:label "Rocket artillery / MLRS" .
bs:BallisticMissileLauncher a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:FiresSystem ; rdfs:label "Ballistic missile TEL" .
bs:CoastalDefenseLauncher a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf bs:FiresSystem ; rdfs:label "Coastal anti-ship missile launcher" .
